  "metadata": {
    "architecture": "k3_resident_decode_stage",
    "purpose": "proposed resident decode-stage firmware for Kimi K3: 3:1 Kimi Delta Attention to gated NoPE MLA, Block Attention Residuals, Stable LatentMoE with SiTU experts, MXFP4 weights, restricted logits",
    "provenance": {
      "status": "proposed driver, built before the weights and technical report land on 2026-07-27",
      "disclosed_source": [
        "kimi.com/blog/kimi-k3",
        "platform.kimi.ai",
        "github.com/MoonshotAI/Attention-Residuals",
        "arXiv:2603.15031 (Attention Residuals)",
        "arXiv:2510.26692 (Kimi Linear)"
      ],
      "disclosed": [
        "2.8T total parameters, MoE",
        "Stable LatentMoE activating 16 of 896 experts alongside shared experts",
        "Kimi Delta Attention hybrid linear attention, 3:1 against full attention",
        "Block Attention Residuals over roughly 8 blocks",
        "Gated MLA (per-head gates on attention output)",
        "SiTU activation: sigmoid(gate) * tanh(up)",
        "MXFP4 weights with MXFP8 activations, QAT from SFT, group size 32",
        "1M context, native vision, always-on thinking"
      ],
      "guessed": [
        "hidden 7168, 72 layers (71 routed + 1 leading dense), moe intermediate 2048: the identity 7168*2048*3*896*71 = 2.801T total and 16*71 experts = 50.0B active closes on the disclosed numbers",
        "K2-lineage MLA dims (query_a 1536, latent 512, qk_nope 128, v 128, 64 heads) with rope dimension 0 per Kimi Linear NoPE",
        "KDA 64 heads at dk = dv = 128, low-rank 128 for decay/beta/gate projections",
        "attention period 4 with MLA last in the period",
        "AttnRes block span 9 layers, which yields the paper's ~8 blocks at 72 layers",
        "vocab 163840, dense intermediate 18432, rms eps 1e-05, routed scaling 2.5",
        "log decay parameterized as -softplus(low_rank(x))"
      ],
      "train_time_only_not_implemented": [
        "Quantile Balancing",
        "Per-Head Muon"
      ]
    },
